# Self-hosted Postgres container's own init credentials, prod environment
# (docs/plans/prod-deploy.md §2 — prod runs Postgres as a container on the VPS itself, unlike
# dev's managed Sumopod instance). Lives ONLY on the VPS at /opt/ammari-prod/env/db.env — never
# in this repo, never in GitHub.
#
# These three values MUST match the user/password/database embedded in admin.env's and web.env's
# own DATABASE_URL (both point at this same `db` service over the internal Docker network) — set
# all three places from the same generated values, once, during one-time server setup
# (docs/plans/prod-deploy.md §4 step 10).
POSTGRES_USER=
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=
POSTGRES_DB=ammari
